WEBVTT

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.340
For the first time in my life...

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:30.850
I'm with a man!

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.300
I'm so happy.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:34.740
'Til death do us part!

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:52.010
Shoot!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.430
I can't believe I threw
myself on that dog girl!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.600
Biggest mistake of my life!

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:06.480
H-Hello? Mitaka speaki--

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:08.010
Oh, Uncle...?

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:10.070
What? Still in bed?

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:12.690
What's the matter with you?

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.380
Like I said, the dogs--

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.720
Shall I have Asuna
go over to nurse you?

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:18.190
Stop it!

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:20.500
I know! You don't want
the one you love...

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.190
to see you in
a frail condition!

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.530
But it's at a time
like this when love--

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.560
Nurse me? Please...

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.160
Say-- That's an idea!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.290
Asuna? Are you listening?

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.600
I'm convinced there's something
wrong with Coach Mitaka's health.

00:02:58.130 --> 00:02:59.890
Why, did he collapse again?

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.040
Yes...

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:07.200
He took Asuna out for a drive
the other day, but he fell ill.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:10.810
He sent her home in a cab.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:11.760
Is that right?

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:14.010
I'm sure he's a fine man...

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.220
but I've heard that
he's been ill since that day.

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:20.750
I just don't know...

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:24.110
He's been ill?

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.700
Hello? Otonashi speaking.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:37.410
Is that you, Coach Mitaka?

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.820
Yes. I'm at home, actually.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.780
I was just wondering
how you're doing.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.450
A-Are you ill?

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:50.080
Yes, for the last few days.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.760
You must be...busy, I suppose?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:56.750
Huh...?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.640
Well, then...

00:03:58.820 --> 00:03:59.810
Um--

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:03.450
It's all right. I just
wanted to hear your voice.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:07.820
I was getting a bit lonely
being sick and by myself.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:11.330
Um... Are you eating okay?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.700
Not for a few days...

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:18.200
Shall I come over
and help you?

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:21.010
No! I'm really not that busy.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.550
Do you need anything?

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.010
All right, then.
I'll come by tomorrow.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.820
And that's the story!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:37.630
So finally, they'll be at
the point of no return.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:42.890
He's probably going to press her
to give him an answer to his proposal.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:46.520
I'm sure she knows all this.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.380
Can't he hear us?

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:51.590
Dunno...

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.010
There.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.620
Good morning.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:42.650
It's almost noon.
What about preschool?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.720
Yes, well...
I'm calling in sick today.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:48.070
I'm feeling tired--

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:51.200
I'm getting old, I guess!

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:56.900
You don't hafta force
a smile for me.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:04.920
Leaving already?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.510
Yes. Can you keep
an eye on things?

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.620
I'll be back
as soon as I can.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.120
See ya!

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:18.170
Where're you going?

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.740
What'll I do if
he makes me stay?

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.120
Manag--

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:24.320
Ms. Otonashi?

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:25.710
Y-Yes.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.950
The door's open.
Please let yourself in.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:34.750
Hello.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.240
Did I just see something?

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:47.440
Please excuse my attire.
I was just shaving.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:48.200
Sure.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.280
Come in, please.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.280
No, I...

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.560
I made you something to eat.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:02.120
I hope you'll like it...

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:10.830
Are you trying to run
from me?

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.100
What am I doing?

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.970
Why did I come here?

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:25.410
Um...

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.790
Have you seen my dog?

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:33.970
It's a little Pomeranian.

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:35.580
A dog?

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:39.730
Yes. I looked away just
for a second, and he--

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:43.900
No...

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:47.430
...Oh, wait! When
the Manager went in...

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.680
I'm sorry.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:54.780
I didn't know how else
to make you stay.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.570
To tell you the truth...

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:01.180
I've been backed
Into a corner.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.660
There's been a misunderstanding...

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.890
which has made that woman
more determined to marry me.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:11.320
I see.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.430
If I don't do something, I--

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:21.810
Ms. Otonashi!

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:29.860
Coach Mitaka.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:37.110
And that woman...
Did she really come here?

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:38.850
There's nowhere else
she could be.

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.360
Ms. Otonashi!

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.030
I--

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.400
Please... Please look at me.

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:50.620
Coach Mitaka--

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:57.100
Ms. Otonashi...
Ms. Otonashi, I--

00:10:58.480 --> 00:10:59.240
I--

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:08.320
My dear Salad!

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:01.370
Godai!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.640
Godai!

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.220
What was Godai doing here?

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:39.960
I'm glad you found him.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.360
Thank you.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:53.400
What a shock to see you
arriving in a Benz!

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:55.850
So who was she?

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.680
Your new girl?

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:02.450
Of course not.
You're not her type.

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:28.970
A broken heart?

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:34.610
Really?

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.400
I owe him an explanation.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.940
He'll understand, I'm sure.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:01.540
Manager!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:02.860
Yes?

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:08.640
Ma told me to give
this back to you.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.850
Thank you.

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.320
What's the matter, Kentaro?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:21.320
Nothing. 'Night!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.700
Good night.

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.260
So? How was the Manager?

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:35.600
She did seem down.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:37.210
Right?

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:40.690
That's strange. I wonder what
happened at Coach Mitaka's place?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.450
Maybe she told him "no."

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:46.080
Well, then there's
hope for Godai again.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.510
But what's the guy doing at
a time like this?

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:22.720
Hello? Shinomi Preschool.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:28.480
Godai? I'm sorry.
He hasn't come in today yet.

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.390
I see.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.230
Thank you.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:42.140
I'm gonna borrow your washer, 'kay?

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.010
I'm using it, all right?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.370
Listen!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:17.210
If you don't want to eat or sleep,
that's your prerogative.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.720
But can't you do something
about that face?!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.720
Hello? This is Sakamoto.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:35.010
Hello, Manager.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:41.460
Godai? He told me to
tell you he's not here.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:45.680
Um... Please ask him
to come home.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:49.870
Tell him I'll explain
everything when he does.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.540
Uh-huh. Bye.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.550
He's got it all wrong.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.920
Let go! I'm not going
back to Maison Ikkoku!

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:09.230
I never said I'm
taking you back there.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:10.300
Then...

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:14.170
If you don't want
to go back, fine.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:19.300
But if you stay inside, your mind
and body are going to rot!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.100
Move around a bit.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.350
All right?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:27.710
There's no point in hiding.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:33.850
I guess you're right.

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:36.490
You're right.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.790
It's just a broken heart!

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.120
You can just move away
and forget the whole thing!

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.100
Whee!!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.590
You're way up high!

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.090
Who's next!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.210
Wait your turn!

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:13.300
Up you go! Whee!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.380
Godai!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:27.130
So the Manager and Coach Mitaka
are finally getting engaged, huh?

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:31.370
Yeah. Who'd you hear it from?

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:37.050
I stopped by yesterday,
and Mrs. Ichinose told me.

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:41.110
I see. Mrs. Ichinose loves to gossip.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.300
Godai?

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:52.190
Yes?

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:57.570
Didn't you have a bit of
a crush on the Manager?

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:05.640
Sure. She's beautiful, sweet...

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:09.980
and she's always been
looking after me.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.290
So she's like
a big sister to you.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:14.500
Uh-huh.

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:19.530
Any guy would fall for
an older woman like that.

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:12.010
Don't tell me you're
staying away another night.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:19.060
You're always like this.
You always jump to conclusions.

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:26.080
Godai!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.310
Um...

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:44.790
Congratulations!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:50.330
You didn't have
to hide it from me!

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.820
Please apologize
to Mitaka for me.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:01.600
Godai.

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:03.890
Wait!

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.460
Godai! Listen!

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.840
About the other day--

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:14.890
Don't worry about it.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.180
It doesn't bother me.

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:26.880
I'm sorry, too. If I had known,
I wouldn't have gone to his condo.

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:30.350
I wouldn't have
given you trouble.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:34.260
If only I had known...

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:39.570
Please...that was--

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:42.810
I've embarrassed myself.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.360
So please leave me alone.

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:49.900
You've got it all wrong.

00:21:50.590 --> 00:21:52.870
It was Coach Mitaka who--

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:57.170
Forget it.
I've given up already.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:01.210
You don't have to
feel sorry for me.

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:05.300
Manager, I...

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:14.230
I...don't have any feelings
for you anymore.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:21.480
I see.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:44.460
M-Manager.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:49.920
Really... Please don't
worry about me.

00:22:50.610 --> 00:22:51.480
Godai...

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:58.660
So you'll be okay without me?

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:03.050
I-I'll be okay.

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:32.820
Why are you crying?

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:35.020
Why?

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:47.120
Manager's going on a trip?

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:49.470
Right. A woman's solitary journey.

00:23:49.560 --> 00:23:51.650
Aren'cha goin' after her?

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:54.180
Manager!!!

00:23:54.690 --> 00:23:58.860
Next: "Come After Me, Godai:
Kyoko Journeys Alone"

00:23:58.960 --> 00:24:00.420
Wait for me, Manager.

00:24:00.490 --> 00:24:02.590
I'm coming after you!
